cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use hermes-rubric in your research, please cite it."
title: "hermes-rubric: Evidence-first assessment for agent outputs and applications"
abstract: >-
  hermes-rubric is a framework-neutral, evidence-first assessment primitive.
  It provides one-call in-memory and path APIs that select or synthesize a
  rubric, collect validated citations, score only against accepted evidence,
  and return coverage, feedback, and a receipt.
